@startuml
title D&D Simple - Dashboard to Room Dice Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Authenticated User" as User
participant "Character Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Characters API" as Api
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Socket.IO Server" as Socket
participant "Room clients\n(TacticalBoardPage)" as Boards

User -> Dashboard: Roll dice in room context
Dashboard -> Api: POST /characters/:id/dice-rolls\n{ roomCode, visibility: "public", roll data }
Api -> DB: Validate ownership and room membership\nthen create DiceRoll with roomId
DB --> Api: Persisted DiceRoll
Api --> Dashboard: 201 DiceRoll

Dashboard -> Socket: dice:roll({ diceRollId })
Socket -> DB: Verify persisted public room roll
DB --> Socket: Public persisted RoomDiceRoll
Socket -> Boards: dice:rolled({ roll })
Boards -> Boards: Merge roll into room dice history

@enduml
